Spring Third-Party Libraries

1. Mapping and DTO
   - MapStruct — DTO-to-entity mapping
   - ModelMapper — Object mapping
   - Lombok — Reduce boilerplate code
   - Immutables — Immutable classes generation

2. JSON and Serialization
   - Jackson — JSON serialization/deserialization
   - Gson — JSON processing

3. Validation
   - Hibernate Validator — Bean validation
   - Jakarta Validation — Validation API

4. Database and Migrations
   - Flyway — Database migrations
   - Liquibase — Database versioning
   - HikariCP — JDBC connection pool
   - Testcontainers — Integration testing with Docker

5. REST and HTTP Clients
   - OpenFeign — Declarative HTTP client
   - Retrofit — HTTP client library
   - Resilience4j — Retry, timeout, circuit breaker
   - Springdoc OpenAPI — Swagger/OpenAPI docs

6. Security
   - jjwt — JWT generation and validation
   - Bouncy Castle — Cryptography
   - Keycloak — Identity and access management

7. Logging and Monitoring
   - SLF4J — Logging facade
   - Logback — Logging backend
   - Log4j2 — Logging backend
   - Micrometer — Metrics and monitoring
   - OpenTelemetry — Tracing and metrics

8. Messaging and Async
   - Kafka Client — Kafka producer/consumer
   - RabbitMQ Java Client — AMQP messaging
   - Project Reactor — Reactive programming

9. Testing
   - JUnit 5 — Unit testing
   - Mockito — Mocking framework
   - AssertJ — Fluent assertions
   - RestAssured — REST API testing
   - WireMock — Mock HTTP services

10. Utilities
   - Apache Commons Lang — Utilities
   - Guava — Utility library
   - Vavr — Functional programming library
